package Example.tally-lsp-client "Tally Server" 1.2.3; contributes configuration, semanticTokenTypes, semanticTokenScopes
activate
createOutputChannel Tally Server
warning: Tally Server: no installed extension contributes the language "tally". This extension serves it beside Example.tally-lang: install it, or rebuild this extension in standalone mode ("mode": "standalone" in its identity.json).
activated
open a typescript document
user setting tally.server.path = "/opt/tally-lsp"
deactivate
dispose channel Tally Server
deactivated
